        <p><seg source="#source-33609-33615">また</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33615-33630"><rb>顔</rb><rt>かほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33630-33633">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33633-33645"><rb>出</rb><rt>だ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33645-33651">して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33651-33666"><rb>窓</rb><rt>まど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33666-33672">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33672-33687"><rb>川</rb><rt>かは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33687-33690">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33690-33702"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33702-33720">た。さつきは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33720-33744"><rb>雨脚</rb><rt>あめあし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33744-33747">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33747-33762"><rb>繁</rb><rt>しげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33762-33774">くつて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33774-33795"><rb>宛然</rb><rt>まるで</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33795-33798">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33798-33822"><rb>薄墨</rb><rt>うすゞみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33822-33825">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33825-33837"><rb>刷</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33837-33852">いたやう、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33852-33870"><rb>堤防</rb><rt>どて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33870-33879">だの、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33879-33903"><rb>石垣</rb><rt>いしがき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33903-33912">だの、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33912-33936"><rb>蛇籠</rb><rt>じやかご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33936-33945">だの、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33945-33966"><rb>中洲</rb><rt>なかず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33966-33969">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-