        <p><seg source="#source-74721-74724">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-74724-74751"><rb>母様</rb><rt>おつかさん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-74751-74766"><rb>遊</rb><rt>あそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-74766-74772">びに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-74772-74784"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby>かうや。」</p>
