        <p>「ねイ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-74910-74922"><rb>出</rb><rt>で</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-74922-74937">かけたつて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-74937-74952"><rb>可</rb><rt>いゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-74952-74958">の、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-74958-74970"><rb>晴</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby>れたんだもの。」</p>
